REPORT Y195R022_CLASSICALRPT.

*here i perform subroutine on non parameterized

PARAMETERS : pinput1 TYPE numc2,
pinput2 TYPE numc3.

data : lv_output TYPE numc4.

PERFORM add.
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& Form add
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& text
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& -->  p1        text
*& <--  p2        text
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM add .
lv_output = pinput1 + pinput2.
WRITE : lv_output.
ENDFORM.